Microware OS-9 Assembler RS Version 01.00.00    07/16/2020 13:05:42                              Page 001CoGrf/CoWin - NitrOS-9 Window Module00001        *******************************************************************00002        * CoGrf/CoWin - NitrOS-9 Text/Graphics Window Module00003        *00004        * $Id$00005        *00006        * Edt/Rev  YYYY/MM/DD  Modified by00007        * Comment00008        * ------------------------------------------------------------------00009        *  19r0    2003/09/23  Robert Gault00010        * Many new patches for 6809 code use.00011        *00012        *  19r1    2003/11/14  Robert Gault00013        * Patches to scrollbar windows to recover arrows and markers.00014        * Includes new stdfonts with graphics added to the end.00015        *00016        *  1       2005/11/26  Boisy G. Pitre00017        * Renamed from WindInt/GrfInt, reset edition.00018        *00019        *          2006/01/09  Robert Gault00020        * Changed Select window routine so that it will work within a script and00021        * DWSet routine so that it will not require a [CLEAR] if the active window00022        * is killed with a display 1b 24 and restarted with a display 1b 20; ie00023        * DWSet. Changes are compatible with MultiVue and all test procedures00024        * tried. Short Sleep added to stabilize the screen change.00025        *00026        *  2       2007/08/22  Boisy G. Pitre00027        * Fixed crash bug in case where grfdrv wasn't loaded.  See comments at00028        * Term label.00029        *  EOU Beta 200030        *  3       2018/11/13  Bill Nobel00031        * Change code (along with Grfdrv) so that loading Grfdrv takes place outside00032        *   of the 64K System workspace, which allows >8K grfdrv to boot properly on00033        *   systems with <16k free in the system memory map.00034        *  EOU Beta 300035        *           2018/12/14  Bill Nobel00036        * Removed Robert Gault's modifications to Select (caused any Select call, even on windows00037        *  not currently viewed on screen, to take over the screen). 00038        *  Bill Nobel & Robert Gault confirmed that fixes Select bug.00039        * EOU Beta 5 - minor optimizations. 6809 DefColr shrunk & sped up.00040        *           2019/06/24  L. Curtis Boyle00041        * Various gr00B5 (W copies) stores removed that are never used00042        * Sped up copying of ARC clip coords by 50 cycles on 6809 (around L0A2Db)/same size 00043        * Curtis planning on adding vectors for block copies and block clears (see level 1 CoVDG),00044        *   16 bit scratch var in static mem (can't use Grfdrv global, since IRQ's can switch between00045        * CoWin/Grf devices) (to use DP addressing instead of pshs (8 or 16 bit)00046        *   /puls to speed various routines up a little bit, like font expansion.00047        *   Eventually, Krn module will get the mini stack blast copy/clear routines00048        *   and set up the vectors to call them in direct page, so that all of the system process00049        *   can access them easily. Grfdrv, since it gets it's own 64k map, will have it's own00050        *   copies and vectors.00051        00052                            nam   CoGrf/CoWin00053                            ttl   NitrOS-9 Window Module00054        00055                            ifp100057                            endc00058        00059   00C1            tylg     set   Systm+Objct00060   0080            atrv     set   ReEnt+rev00061   0000            rev      set   $00Microware OS-9 Assembler RS Version 01.00.00    07/16/2020 13:05:43                              Page 002CoGrf/CoWin - NitrOS-9 Window Module00062   0002            edition  equ   200063        00064        * Color table for 3D look stuff & others00065        * This should now match VIEW's color table (darkest to lightest for predictable00066        * brightness). Any color scheme following that rule shouldn't look bad.00067        * NOTE: CURRENTLY WCOLOR1/2 ARE REVERSED, LABEL WISE. SHOULD FIX THESE AND THE ENTRIES THAT R00068        *  TO THEM SO IT IS MORE CLEAR.00069   0000            WColor0  equ   0          black00070   0002            WColor1  equ   2          dark grey (was lite grey)00071   0001            WColor2  equ   1          light grey (dark grey)00072   0003            WColor3  equ   3          (white)00073        00074   0000 87CD1D71            mod   eom,name,tylg,atrv,entry,size00075 D 0000            size     equ   .00076        00077   000D            name     equ   *00078                            IFEQ  CoGrf-100080                            ELSE00081   000D 436F5769            fcs   /CoWin/00082                            ENDC00083   0012 02                  fcb   edition00084        00085        ****************************00086        * Escape code parameter vector table00087        * Format: Byte 1  : Length of parameters required (in bytes)00088        *         Byte 2  : Internal function code for GrfDrv00089        *         Byte 3-4: Vector offset of routine from Byte 100090        00091   0013 0704       L0027    fcb   7,$04      DWSet00092   0015 03B3                fdb   DWSet-*+200093   0017 0010                fcb   0,$10      Select00094   0019 0542                fdb   Select-*+200095   001B 070A                fcb   7,$0A      OWSet00096   001D 04A4                fdb   OWSet-*+200097   001F 000C                fcb   0,$0C      OWEnd00098   0021 04F7                fdb   OWEnd-*+200099   0023 0008                fcb   0,$08      DWEnd00100   0025 044D                fdb   DWEnd-*+200101   0027 040E                fcb   4,$0E      CWArea00102   0029 058C                fdb   CWArea-*+200103   002B FF00                fcb   $ff,$00    Blank (free for new function)00104   002D 0000                fdb   $000000105   002F FF00                fcb   $