 at00331                            ELSE00339                            ENDC00340   019D D732                stb   <$32       Clear out block #'s for G/P buffer (Current,00341   019F D735                stb   <$35       previous)00342   01A1 DD39                std   <$39       Text cursor & gfx cursors off00343   01A3 4F         L0102    clra00344   01A4 1F8B                tfr   a,dp       Set DP to 0 for Wind/CoGrf, which need it there00345   01A6 6C47                inc   MD$Link+1,u Increment it's link count00346        * new code to get GrfDrv exec addr. BN00347   01A8 CC0000              ldd   #000348   01AB 8E0009              ldx   #M$Exec00349   01AE 108E118B            ldy   #$118B00350   01B2 103F48              os9   F$LDDDXY00351   01B5 8A40                ora   #$4000352        * end of new code00353 W 01B7 FD106E              std   >WGlobal+G.GrfEnt Save it00354                            IFNE  H630900355 W 01BA 71801024            oim   #$80,>WGlobal+G.BCFFlg Indicate that Grfdrv has been found?00356                            ELSE00360                            ENDC00361        * Initialize GFX tables.00362   01BE CC02FF              ldd   #$02FF     Get how many bytes we need00363   01C1 103F28              os9   F$SRqMem   Reserve it (note: only $2cf is used so far)00364   01C4 1025FF56            lbcs  L0166      Can't get memory, exit00365 W 01C8 FF1075              stu   >WGlobal+G.GfxTbl Save the pointer to GFX tables (NOT IN GLOBAL!)00366        * Later, when we make Grfdrv specific generic fast clear routine vector, have00367        *   both sets of clears call it (both 6809 and 6309) LCB00368                            IFNE  H630900369   01CB 1F06                tfr   d,w        Move mem size to W00370   01CD 318C0C              leay  <Nul0+2,pc Clear them all to NUL's00371   01D0 113B23              tfm   y,u+00372 W 01D3 10B71022            stw   >WGlobal+G.PrWMPt initialize previous window table pointer